  pm-7ivxas,related,"2026-11-13T03:07:36.320Z","harness:claude-code","cli:update:dep",detected
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-13T03:07:35.568Z","harness:claude-code","Scope note from PR 1717 (CodeRabbit major on the plan projection): read outputs show legacy stored identities as stored by design, and this item reports them for rewrite. The report should therefore also cover the nested identity locations the write-side table now judges (comments, notes and learnings authors, dependency authors, plan decision, discovery and step owners, and linked-test provenance and updated_by authors, the table pm-7ivxas completed), so a legacy plan step owner that pm plan show prints as stored is found and rewritten rather than redacted in one projection only.\n"
